de342c85efbcfc058c93f508f09ad72de1f/ss_fb62ade342c85efbcfc058c93f508f09ad72de1f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757552362","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096450/fb62ade342c85efbcfc058c93f508f09ad72de1f/ss_fb62ade342c85efbcfc058c93f508f09ad72de1f.600x338.jpg?t=1757552362"}],"short_description":"Inspired by 90s and 2000s survival horror, Decaying Salvage is a sci-fi, fixed camera horror game. Explore derelict spaceships, scavenge parts by solving puzzles, encounter a variety of unique enemies, and find a way to return home to Earth.","steam_appid":3096450,"support_info":{"email":"support@stasisboothgames.com","url":"https://stasisboothgames.com/contact-us/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://stasisboothgames.com/decaying-salvage/"}